  "description": {
   "en": "\"My beloved in my memory is crying. I have memories of my previous life.\"\n\nTia was chosen as a sacrificial saint to be offered to the demon tribe to protect the peace of the human kingdom from the threat of the demon tribe. However, what she encounters is different from the terrible demon king she has heard rumors about...! And then, she gets caught up in a war that has been set up.\n\nLove and memories lead the way in this romance fantasy!"
  },
